  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 03 Proposed Plans March 2025&lt;br&gt;- 04 Proposed Elevations March 2025&lt;br&gt;- 05 Proposed Section March 2025&lt;br&gt;- 07A Revised Proposed Block Plan August 2025&lt;br&gt;- 09 Cycle Storage Details March 2025&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "Refuse\r\nDetails\r\n\r\nNotwithstanding\r\nthe details submitted with the application, prior to above ground works, full\r\ndetails of refuse storage shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the\r\nlocal planning authority. Prior to occupation, the approved details shall be\r\nfully implemented. Thereafter, the refuse storage shall be permanently\r\nretained.",
    "&nbsp;Waste\r\nManagement\r\n\r\nNotwithstanding\r\nthe details submitted with the application, prior to above ground works, full\r\ndetails of waste management shall be submitted to and approved in writing by\r\nthe local planning authority. Prior to occupation, the approved details shall\r\nbe fully implemented. Thereafter, the refuse storage shall be permanently\r\nretained.",
    "Security conditionThe proposed development shall achieve Secured by design principles to the satisfaction of the local authority &amp; Metropolitan Police, details of which shall be provided to the Local Planning Authority for its written approval prior to the first occupation of the approved development. All security measures applied to the approved development shall be permanently retained thereafter."
  ],
